# oracle: pair dpd/tstat with its random force on (pair temperature 300 K), cg SPC/E water, 20 steps (native neighbor-list order)
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): engine vs native max error 1.9e-14 (thermo), 4.4e-15 (per-atom), scale max(1,|x|). Random force ON (pair temperature 300 K), cg SPC/E water (2180 atoms), 20 steps.
# oracle-inputs: w77dpd_cg_spce.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-10 abs=0
units            real
boundary     p p p
atom_style   atomic
dimension    3
newton       on
comm_modify  vel yes
read_data    w77dpd_cg_spce.data
pair_style       dpd/tstat 300.0 300.0 10.0 385262
pair_coeff   1 1 10.0 10.0
timestep    1.0
run_style   verlet
velocity all create 300.0 68768932
thermo_style custom step time temp press pe ke
thermo_modify format float %.15g
thermo       5
fix 1 all    nve
run          20
